00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:14.060
Um, I have a question...

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:17.200
Was there something in the 
lecture you didn't understand?

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.160
It isn't that.

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:24.660
Why do people in the Ikeda 
lab group wear lab coats?

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.670
Oh. Is it strange?

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:30.420
No, not at all! It's really cool, but...

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:35.170
Everyone in the other labs wears regular 
clothes, so we just wondered why.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.990
It's sort of a tradition in our lab.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.620
It isn't compulsory or anything, though.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:44.550
