that this is our armor.

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:48.560
That's because when we wear lab 
coats we look smart and cool!

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:52.130
In psychological terms, you could say 
it provides a definition of roles.

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:57.590
People tend to become more like the clothes 
they wear and the roles they're given.

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:02.030
When you dress nicely, it makes you feel 
more positive about things, right?

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.090
That's true.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:06.130
Donning a lab coat, 
a symbol of intelligence,

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:10.960
