befitting that of scholars!

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:13.410
Speaking of which...

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:16.930
Professor, why don't you wear a lab coat?

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:18.130
Gulp.

00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:22.550
True. I don't think I've ever seen 
the professor wear a lab coat.

00:01:22.550 --> 00:01:26.090
I do, of course, want to wear one...

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:30.730
