00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:50.530
Serotonin tells you about 
their emotional stability.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:53.930
Estrogen tells you about the 
balance within a female body.

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:58.200
From testosterone, you can read 
the degree of masculine vitality.

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:05.320
